{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/877638-sidereal-martial-arts-in-3e","id":877638,"title":"Sidereal Martial Arts in 3e?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-29T06:49:22-07:00","id":877638,"title":"Sidereal Martial Arts in 3e?","content":"I'm not 100% clear on this. Will there be sidereal martial arts in 3e, or will they all just be &quot;martial arts&quot;? Also, do you know if there will be martial art charms with higher essence requirement (ie 4 or 5) ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9120-akodo","name":"Akodo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:04:14-07:00","id":877645,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure the book implies that SMA will be a thing, but I'm at a complete loss as to how it will be modelled. In theory if they're MA even terrestrials can learn them, but I think when the Sid book comes out we'll find they're a special exception.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:06:53-07:00","id":877646,"title":"","content":"From the core, IIRC, there's mention that Sidereals know secret martial arts techniques beyond the ken of the Solar or Abyssal Exalted's ability to independently develop, although they are capable of being taught. We can also be relatively confident that they won't be the Essence 6+ monsters that came before.<br /> <br /> We know basically nothing else about them at this point, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/874378-musing-on-sidereal-martial-arts\">although I've got my speculations</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Storyteller Vault releases!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/269728/Sorcerous-Ways-Mystic-Martial-Arts\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerous Ways: Mystic Martial Arts</a> - Punch people for magic power!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/252892/These-Mean-Streets\" target=\"_blank\">These Mean Streets</a> - Advise and systems for street-level punk-noir Vampire larp","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens","name":"wastevens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"939"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:07:31-07:00","id":877648,"title":"","content":"Sidereal MA will be a thing. They will not be the same as 2nd. I don't know what sort of thing they will be, or how they will be different from regular MA. Maybe a Mastery like keyword called Sidereal? Maybe higher essence requirements? Maybe gated behind special things?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2132-ejtaka","name":"Ejtaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2132_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1064"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:17:54-07:00","id":877654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wastevens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/877638-sidereal-martial-arts-in-3e?p=877646#post877646\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From the core, IIRC, there's mention that Sidereals know secret martial arts techniques beyond the ken of the Solar or Abyssal Exalted's ability to independently develop, although they are capable of being taught. We can also be relatively confident that they won't be the Essence 6+ monsters that came before.<br /> <br /> We know basically nothing else about them at this point, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/874378-musing-on-sidereal-martial-arts\">although I've got my speculations</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>This. Given the overall shift in MA, I feel it's safe to say the implementation will be different from previous editions. I think the over-reliance on MA for Sidereals jammed them up a bit, and that spilled over to the other splats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6601-totentanz","name":"Totentanz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6601_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T08:58:46-07:00","id":877753,"title":"","content":"Here is the exact-words of what we know about Sidereal MA so far.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Those who remember the Sidereals of old agree on one thing: they were martial artists whose genius was without compare. Only the Solar Exalted could boast equal prowess, and then only under the tutelage of a Sidereal mentor. Their mystical \ufb01ghting systems, the Sidereal Martial Arts, are the whispered legends and ultimate secret styles of the martial arts world. </div> </div> </div>And we have this from the MA Keywords section<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Mastery: This keyword denotes Charms that have a greater effect when used by those Exalted who are masters of mortal Abilities: the Solar and Abyssal Exalted. The Sidereal Exalted, peerless masters of the martial arts, have their own esoteric methods for accessing these effects. </div> </div> </div>And that's all we know so far. They'll be there, they'll be awesome, but they probably won't be out of reach for most players until they hit uber-Essence levels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3937-guildsbounty","name":"guildsbounty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}